---
layout: null
permalink: /sitemap.xml
---
<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
{% assign site_origin = site.url | default: 'https://zaryob.github.io' %}
{% assign site_root = '/' | relative_url | prepend: site_origin %}
{% comment %}
Each page has one canonical URL and only that URL is listed: the application,
its sections, and the generated pages per ABI and per syscall name. Views inside a
page (?arch=, ?q=, ?lang=) are client-side states of it and would contradict
the canonical link in the layout.
{% endcomment %}
<urlset xmlns="http://www.sitemaps.org/schemas/sitemap/0.9">
  <url>
    <loc>{{ site_root }}</loc>
    {% if site.data.syscall_release.updated %}<lastmod>{{ site.data.syscall_release.updated }}</lastmod>{% endif %}
    <changefreq>weekly</changefreq>
    <priority>1.0</priority>
  </url>
  {% assign listed_pages = site.pages | where: 'sitemap', true | sort: 'url' %}
  {% for listed in listed_pages %}
  {% if listed.static_page %}
  {% comment %}Generated per ABI and per syscall name. No lastmod: a re-import renews the snapshot date without changing most of these pages.{% endcomment %}
  <url><loc>{{ listed.url | relative_url | prepend: site_origin }}</loc></url>
  {% else %}
  <url>
    <loc>{{ listed.url | relative_url | prepend: site_origin }}</loc>
    {% if site.data.syscall_release.abi_updated %}<lastmod>{{ site.data.syscall_release.abi_updated }}</lastmod>{% endif %}
    <changefreq>monthly</changefreq>
    <priority>0.8</priority>
  </url>
  {% endif %}
  {% endfor %}
</urlset>
